# Optional VS Code REST Client examples. Use your actual published graph and UUIDs.
@api = http://localhost:8001
@graph = graph:first-graph-v1

### Published graph versions
GET {{api}}/api/collaboration/versions

### Eligible role nodes
GET {{api}}/api/collaboration/{{graph}}/nodes?role=director&limit=20

### Connections
GET {{api}}/api/collaboration/{{graph}}/edges?limit=6

### Graph manifest and report
GET {{api}}/api/collaboration/{{graph}}/report
